<title>USA: TABLE- PriCellular Q2 shr loss $0.18 vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE- PriCellular Q2 shr loss $0.18 vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.18     loss	 $0.18</p>
<p> Net	  loss	  5,405     loss	 5,354</p>
<p> Revs			43,172		   27,106</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,408		   38,491</p>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.21     loss	 $0.40</p>
<p> Net	  loss	  5,015     loss	12,302</p>
<p> Revs			78,738		   48,368</p>
<p> Avg			 38,731		   38,495</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is PriCellular Corp. Per share earnings reflect accrued preferred stock dividends. The six months figures for 1997 include a $8.5 million gain on the sale of the company's Florence, Ala., cellular systems. The 1996 figures are adjusted for stock splits.</p>
